[
    {
        "id": "tls-client-flow",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Modbus TLS Client Example",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "This flow demonstrates secure Modbus TCP client operations with TLS encryption.\n\n## Features\n- TLS/SSL encrypted Modbus TCP communication\n- Certificate-based authentication\n- Read holding registers, coils, input registers, and discrete inputs\n- Write operations with TLS security\n- Connection monitoring and error handling\n\n## Setup\n1. Generate certificates using the provided script\n2. Configure the TLS certificates in the Modbus client node\n3. Ensure the Modbus TLS server is running\n4. Deploy the flow and test secure communication",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "modbus-client-tls",
        "type": "modbus-client",
        "name": "Secure Modbus Client (TLS)",
        "clienttype": "tcp",
        "bufferCommands": true,
        "stateLogEnabled": false,
        "queueLogEnabled": false,
        "failureLogEnabled": true,
        "tcpHost": "127.0.0.1",
        "tcpPort": "8502",
        "tcpType": "TPC-RTU-BUFFERED",
        "serialPort": "/dev/ttyUSB",
        "serialType": "RTU-BUFFERED",
        "serialBaudrate": "9600",
        "serialDatabits": "8",
        "serialStopbits": "1",
        "serialParity": "none",
        "serialConnectionDelay": "100",
        "serialAsciiResponseStartDelimiter": "0x3A",
        "unit_id": "1",
        "commandDelay": "1",
        "clientTimeout": "1000",
        "reconnectOnTimeout": true,
        "reconnectTimeout": "2000",
        "parallelUnitIdsAllowed": true,
        "tlsOptions": {
            "type": "tls-config",
            "id": "tls-config-client"
        }
    },
    {
        "id": "tls-config-client",
        "type": "tls-config",
        "name": "Client TLS Config",
        "cert": "${payload.clientCert}",
        "key": "${payload.clientKey}",
        "ca": "${payload.caCert}",
        "certname": "client-cert.pem",
        "keyname": "client-key.pem",
        "caname": "ca-cert.pem",
        "servername": "modbus-server",
        "verifyservercert": true,
        "alpnprotocol": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "read-holding-registers",
        "type": "modbus-read",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Read Temperature & Humidity",
        "topic": "",
        "showStatusActivities": true,
        "logIOActivities": false,
        "showErrors": true,
        "showWarnings": true,
        "unitid": "1",
        "dataType": "HoldingRegister",
        "adr": "0",
        "quantity": "10",
        "rate": "5",
        "rateUnit": "s",
        "delayOnStart": false,
        "startDelayTime": "",
        "server": "modbus-client-tls",
        "useIOFile": false,
        "ioFile": "",
        "useIOForPayload": false,
        "emptyMsgOnFail": false,
        "x": 230,
        "y": 140,
        "wires": [
            ["parse-sensor-data"],
            ["modbus-response-filter"]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "parse-sensor-data",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Parse Sensor Data",
        "func": "// Parse the Modbus response data\nif (msg.payload && msg.payload.length >= 7) {\n    let data = msg.payload;\n    \n    msg.payload = {\n        temperature: data[0] / 10,  // Convert back from x10\n        humidity: data[1] / 10,     // Convert back from x10\n        pressure: data[2],\n        timestamp: (data[4] << 16) | data[3],\n        deviceId: '0x' + data[5].toString(16).toUpperCase(),\n        firmware: `${(data[6] >> 8) & 0xFF}.${data[6] & 0xFF}`,\n        randomValue: data[7],\n        status: '0x' + data[8].toString(16).toUpperCase(),\n        errorCode: '0x' + data[9].toString(16).toUpperCase(),\n        secure: true,\n        protocol: 'Modbus/TLS'\n    };\n    \n    msg.topic = 'sensor/data';\n    return msg;\n}\n\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 530,
        "y": 120,
        "wires": [["display-sensor-data", "chart-temperature"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "display-sensor-data",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Sensor Data",
        "active": true,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": true,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "statusVal": "payload.temperature",
        "statusType": "msg",
        "x": 750,
        "y": 120
    },
    {
        "id": "modbus-response-filter",
        "type": "modbus-response-filter",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Filter Modbus Response",
        "filter": "AllEx",
        "registers": 0,
        "ioFile": "",
        "x": 530,
        "y": 180,
        "wires": [["raw-modbus-data"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "raw-modbus-data",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Raw Modbus Data",
        "active": false,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": false,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "x": 770,
        "y": 180
    },
    {
        "id": "write-control",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Write Control Value",
        "props": [
            {
                "p": "payload"
            }
        ],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": false,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "",
        "payload": "42",
        "payloadType": "num",
        "x": 170,
        "y": 280,
        "wires": [["prepare-write"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "prepare-write",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Prepare Write Data",
        "func": "// Prepare data for writing to holding register\nmsg.payload = {\n    value: msg.payload,\n    fc: 6,  // Function code 6: Write single register\n    unitid: 1,\n    address: 7,  // Write to register 7 (random value)\n    quantity: 1\n};\n\nreturn msg;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 370,
        "y": 280,
        "wires": [["modbus-write-tls"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "modbus-write-tls",
        "type": "modbus-write",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Write Register (TLS)",
        "showStatusActivities": true,
        "showErrors": true,
        "showWarnings": true,
        "unitid": "1",
        "dataType": "HoldingRegister",
        "adr": "7",
        "quantity": "1",
        "server": "modbus-client-tls",
        "emptyMsgOnFail": false,
        "keepMsgProperties": false,
        "delayOnStart": false,
        "startDelayTime": "",
        "x": 580,
        "y": 280,
        "wires": [
            ["write-result"],
            ["write-response"]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "write-result",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Write Result",
        "active": true,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": true,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "statusVal": "payload",
        "statusType": "auto",
        "x": 770,
        "y": 260
    },
    {
        "id": "write-response",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Write Response",
        "active": false,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": false,
        "complete": "true",
        "targetType": "full",
        "x": 780,
        "y": 320
    },
    {
        "id": "read-coils",
        "type": "modbus-read",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Read Coils (Digital)",
        "topic": "",
        "showStatusActivities": true,
        "logIOActivities": false,
        "showErrors": true,
        "showWarnings": true,
        "unitid": "1",
        "dataType": "Coil",
        "adr": "0",
        "quantity": "16",
        "rate": "10",
        "rateUnit": "s",
        "delayOnStart": false,
        "startDelayTime": "",
        "server": "modbus-client-tls",
        "useIOFile": false,
        "ioFile": "",
        "useIOForPayload": false,
        "emptyMsgOnFail": false,
        "x": 210,
        "y": 400,
        "wires": [
            ["parse-coils"],
            []
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "parse-coils",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Parse Coil Status",
        "func": "// Parse coil (digital) status\nif (msg.payload && Array.isArray(msg.payload)) {\n    let coilStatus = {};\n    \n    msg.payload.forEach((value, index) => {\n        coilStatus[`coil_${index}`] = value;\n    });\n    \n    msg.payload = {\n        coils: coilStatus,\n        totalOn: msg.payload.filter(v => v).length,\n        totalOff: msg.payload.filter(v => !v).length,\n        secure: true,\n        timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n    };\n    \n    msg.topic = 'coils/status';\n    return msg;\n}\n\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 510,
        "y": 400,
        "wires": [["display-coils"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "display-coils",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Coil Status",
        "active": true,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": true,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "statusVal": "payload.totalOn",
        "statusType": "msg",
        "x": 750,
        "y": 400
    },
    {
        "id": "connection-monitor",
        "type": "status",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Monitor TLS Connection",
        "scope": ["modbus-client-tls"],
        "x": 210,
        "y": 500,
        "wires": [["parse-connection"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "parse-connection",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Parse TLS Status",
        "func": "// Parse TLS connection status\nif (msg.status) {\n    let status = msg.status.text || '';\n    let isConnected = status.includes('connected') || status.includes('active');\n    let isSecure = isConnected; // If connected via our TLS client, it's secure\n    \n    msg.payload = {\n        connected: isConnected,\n        secure: isSecure,\n        status: status,\n        protocol: isSecure ? 'Modbus/TLS' : 'Modbus/TCP',\n        encryption: isSecure ? 'TLS 1.2+' : 'None',\n        timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n        details: msg.status\n    };\n    \n    msg.topic = 'connection/status';\n    return msg;\n}\n\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 450,
        "y": 500,
        "wires": [["display-connection"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "display-connection",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "TLS Connection Status",
        "active": true,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": true,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "statusVal": "payload.protocol",
        "statusType": "msg",
        "x": 690,
        "y": 500
    },
    {
        "id": "chart-temperature",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Prepare Chart Data",
        "func": "// Prepare data for charting\nif (msg.payload && msg.payload.temperature !== undefined) {\n    return {\n        topic: 'Temperature (°C)',\n        payload: msg.payload.temperature,\n        timestamp: Date.now()\n    };\n}\n\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 530,
        "y": 60,
        "wires": [["temperature-trend"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "temperature-trend",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Temperature Trend",
        "active": false,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": false,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "x": 770,
        "y": 60
    },
    {
        "id": "comment-tls-setup",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "TLS Client Configuration",
        "info": "## TLS Client Setup\n\n1. **Generate Certificates:**\n   ```bash\n   cd examples/tls-secure-modbus/certs\n   ./generate-certificates.sh\n   ```\n\n2. **Configure Client TLS:**\n   - Client Certificate: `client-cert.pem`\n   - Client Private Key: `client-key.pem`\n   - CA Certificate: `ca-cert.pem`\n   - Server Name: `modbus-server`\n\n3. **Connection Details:**\n   - Host: 127.0.0.1 (or server IP)\n   - Port: 8502 (TLS port)\n   - Protocol: Modbus/TCP over TLS\n\n4. **Security Features:**\n   - Encrypted communication\n   - Certificate-based authentication\n   - Server certificate verification\n   - Protection against MITM attacks",
        "x": 210,
        "y": 40
    },
    {
        "id": "test-connection",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Test TLS Connection",
        "props": [
            {
                "p": "payload"
            },
            {
                "p": "topic",
                "vt": "str"
            }
        ],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": false,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "test",
        "payload": "true",
        "payloadType": "bool",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 580,
        "wires": [["force-reconnect"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "force-reconnect",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Force Reconnect",
        "func": "// Force a reconnection to test TLS handshake\nmsg.payload = {\n    action: 'reconnect',\n    testTLS: true\n};\n\nreturn msg;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "timeout": "",
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 390,
        "y": 580,
        "wires": [["test-result"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "test-result",
        "type": "debug",
        "z": "tls-client-flow",
        "name": "Connection Test",
        "active": true,
        "tosidebar": true,
        "console": false,
        "tostatus": false,
        "complete": "payload",
        "targetType": "msg",
        "x": 600,
        "y": 580
    }
]